    covers: [],
    body: 'When you run TrueForge ([Quickstart](/quickstart)), open the app URL (for example `http://localhost:8790`). You get:\n\n- Agent composer and [Agent Library](/agent-library)\n- Streaming chat with tool calls, approvals, and ask-user-questions\n- Settings for [models](/models), [connectors](/mcp-servers), [skills](/skills), and [sandbox](/sandbox)\n- [Generative UI](/create-agent/overview#whats-in-an-agent) rendering out of the box\n\nPublic source: https://github.com/ClimbOutLabs/amanuensis/blob/main/docs/chat-ui.mdx',
