    body: "This page tracks the major directions we're investing in. It is directional, not a committed schedule — priorities and ordering may change. To influence it, open an issue or discussion on [GitHub](https://github.com/ClimbOutLabs/amanuensis).\n\nPublic source: https://github.com/ClimbOutLabs/amanuensis/blob/main/docs/roadmap.mdx",
