    covers: [],
    body: '- **Models and MCP servers from a gateway** — pull model providers and MCP servers from a gateway, instead of configuring each one by hand. One place for credentials, access control, and usage across every agent.\n\nPublic source: https://github.com/ClimbOutLabs/amanuensis/blob/main/docs/roadmap.mdx',
