    covers: [],
    body: '- **Local sandbox execution** — run the sandbox on your own machine in [local mode](/introduction#two-ways-to-run-it), so the Claude Desktop-like setup gets code execution without a remote sandbox provider.\n\nPublic source: https://github.com/ClimbOutLabs/amanuensis/blob/main/docs/roadmap.mdx',
